        },
        {
          "text": "Nao orekoghe na mruna wa waka uwangwagha Maria, uo oreserieghe kidombo maghunyi kwa Jesu ukighisikiria mafundisho ghake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.39",
